{"lines": ["In 1984, after Monoun, a similar threat from Nyos was not anticipated. Two years later, it happened.", "That is the lesson. The warning was there, and it was not read as a warning.", "After Nyos, engineers built what was needed. A degassing tube, which siphons water from the bottom layers to the top, so the gas can leak out in safe amounts. The first was installed in 2001. Two more followed in 2011.", "A pilot demonstration had already been done at Monoun in 1992 and at Nyos in 1995.", "Nyos is one of only three lakes known to be saturated with carbon dioxide this way. The others are Monoun, and Lake Kivu, between the Democratic Republic of the Congo and Rwanda.", "Rule six. When something happens once, treat it as a warning, and then fix the lake."], "words": [["In", 0.0, 0.1], ["1984,", 0.1, 0.68], ["after", 1.5, 1.8], ["Monoun,", 1.8, 2.58], ["a", 2.58, 2.68], ["similar", 2.68, 2.98], ["threat", 2.98, 3.38], ["from", 3.38, 3.62], ["Nyos", 3.62, 4.18], ["was", 4.18, 4.3], ["not", 4.3, 4.52], ["anticipated.", 4.52, 4.98], ["Two", 5.92, 6.06], ["years", 6.06, 6.28], ["later,", 6.28, 6.56], ["it", 6.56, 6.88], ["happened.", 6.88, 7.18], ["That", 8.14, 8.3], ["is", 8.3, 8.5], ["the", 8.5, 8.66], ["lesson.", 8.66, 8.96], ["The", 9.44, 9.5], ["warning", 9.5, 9.7], ["was", 9.7, 10.02], ["there,", 10.02, 10.32], ["and", 10.32, 10.56], ["it", 10.56, 10.66], ["was", 10.66, 10.74], ["not", 10.74, 10.94], ["read", 10.94, 11.26], ["as", 11.26, 11.52], ["a", 11.52, 11.6], ["warning.", 11.6, 11.92], ["After", 12.8, 13.12], ["Nyos,", 13.12, 13.72], ["engineers", 13.72, 14.06], ["built", 14.06, 14.54], ["what", 14.54, 14.78], ["was", 14.78, 14.94], ["needed.", 14.94, 15.18], ["A", 15.74, 15.82], ["degassing", 15.82, 16.3], ["tube,", 16.3, 16.6], ["which", 16.6, 16.94], ["siphons", 16.94, 17.42], ["water", 17.42, 17.72], ["from", 17.72, 17.98], ["the", 17.98, 18.08], ["bottom", 18.08, 18.38], ["layers", 18.38, 18.68], ["to", 18.68, 18.96], ["the", 18.96, 19.04], ["top,"